        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo mwami wakaambila batumwa mbaakaimvwi abo wati, Amuboole, mubajaye bapaizi ba-Jehova, nkaambo abalo balagwasya Davida, nkaambo bakalizi kuti waloboka, pele teebakandilwiida makani pe, Pele balanda bamwami teebakali kuyanda kuti maanza aabo abaume bapaizi ba-Jehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.17",
