        {
          "text": "Lino mwami wakaambila Doegi kuti, Boola webo, ukabaume bapaizi. Elyo Doegi mu-Edomi wakaboola kuzoobauma bapaizi, nkabela mubuzuba obo wakajaya bantu bali makumi aali musanu aatatu abasanu ibakasamide cikobela cituba cabupaizi. ",
